  articleCol.appendChild(para('Placeholder copy continuing the thought, noting that most pairings work best when one typeface handles headings and a second, quieter typeface carries body copy, captions, and interface labels throughout the rest of the experience across every screen.'));

  articleCol.appendChild(h2('Think about contrast and hierarchy'));
